+These two unchanged TextMeshPro shader files and their metadata come from the
+already installed Unity UI package's `Package Resources/TMP Essential Resources.unitypackage`:
+
+- `Assets/TextMesh Pro/Shaders/TMP_SDF-Mobile.shader`
